       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SANRT8.
      * REAL-TIME SANCTIONS SCREEN ROUTER
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY SANTB8.
       01  WS-SCREEN-ROUTE           PIC X(6) VALUE 'BYPASS'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-LIST-ID
           IF REQUIRED-UNSC-LIST
              MOVE 'SCREEN' TO WS-SCREEN-ROUTE
           ELSE
              MOVE 'BYPASS' TO WS-SCREEN-ROUTE
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'ROUTE: ' WS-SCREEN-ROUTE
           STOP RUN.
